---
title: Domain
---
flowchart LR
    Rider([Rider]) -->|taps card on a bus| Tap[Tap<br/>time · ON/OFF · stop · bus · company · PAN]
    Tap -->|grouped by PAN| Card[Card's taps]
    Card -->|sorted by time,<br/>ON before OFF at the same time| Matching{{Trip matching rules}}

    Matching --> Completed[Completed trip<br/>ON then OFF at another stop]
    Matching --> Cancelled[Cancelled trip<br/>ON then OFF at the same stop]
    Matching --> Incomplete[Incomplete trip<br/>ON with no OFF]
    Matching --> Unmatched[Unmatched trip<br/>can't be charged]

    Fares[(Fare table · AUD<br/>one fare per stop pair,<br/>both directions)] --> Pricing{{Pricing rules}}
    Completed --> Pricing
    Cancelled --> Pricing
    Incomplete --> Pricing

    Pricing -->|fare between the stops| Charged[Charged trip]
    Pricing -->|max fare from the tap on stop| Charged
    Pricing -->|$0.00| Charged
    Pricing -->|no fare for the stops| Unmatched

    Charged --> Output[/trips.csv/]
    Unmatched --> Log[/Log: reason + masked card/]
